# Level One base policy

Standing company policy. Skills live under `.agents/skills/` — HQ in `base/`, one folder per job org. Depth lives in those files; this rule only binds them.

## Always on — follow every request (`base/`)

- `dispatcher`
- `agent-talk`
- `agent-plan`
- `verification-floor`
- `hard-safety`

## Writing floor — when its triggers hit

- `asd-ste100` — apply when English will be parsed by another agent or misreading is costly; not for creative/marketing copy. See that skill’s description.

## Dispatcher first

At the start of every request, run `dispatcher`: classify size and shape, state which job orgs are on, then **open each staffed org’s `SKILL.md` and follow it**. Job orgs stay discoverable; staff them via dispatcher, or when Cursor/user already matched one with justification.

Do not paste full skill checklists here — open the `SKILL.md` files.
